※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4410 LANG_TYPEDEF_REPEATED_TYPE

※ An arm of a `match` names the type of the alternative it takes, so two
※ alternatives of one type would be two an arm could not choose between.  It
※ is a rule about sums and not about products: a product holds all of its
※ fields and reaches each by name.

type Twice = first : u8 | second : u8

type Fine = a : u8 ; b : u8

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    0u6
